122
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:30,810
Black Friday also empties the warehouse.

123
00:04:30,810 --> 00:04:33,690
Stock that sits loses value.

124
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:36,161
Moving it before the new year turns

125
00:04:36,161 --> 00:04:38,362
