00:05:33,928 --> 00:05:35,629
nine point three billion dollars in

152
00:05:35,629 --> 00:05:36,867
revenue each.

153
00:05:37,127 --> 00:05:39,464
The holiday quarter brought in thirteen

154
00:05:39,464 --> 00:05:41,467
point eight billion dollars.

155
00:05:41,667 --> 00:05:44,567
That tall bar is the season retailers

156
00:05:44,567 --> 00:05:46,907
