00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:27,353
Ninety-two percent of them were the same

292
00:10:27,353 --> 00:10:29,400
price or cheaper at other times of

293
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:30,410
the year.

294
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:31,739
That's one study,

295
00:10:31,739 --> 00:10:33,250
in one country.

296
00:10:33,250 --> 00:10:35,215
But the lesson travels.

297
00:10:35,450 --> 00:10:38,160
Let me draw how that happens.

298
00:10:38,190 --> 00:10:40,280
Here's one price over a year.

299
00:10:40,330 --> 00:10:42,190
It sits high for a while.

300
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:44,030
That's the reference price.

301
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,898
Then it drops for Black Friday,

302
00:10:45,898 --> 00:10:47,970
and the tag shouts a big percentage

303
00:10:47,970 --> 00:10:49,260
off the high.

304
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:50,230
But look.

305
00:10:50,230 --> 00:10:51,590
It was this low in the summer

306
00:10:51,590 --> 00:10:52,330
too.

307
00:10:52,330 --> 00:10:54,810
The discount is real against the tag.

308
00:10:54,810 --> 00:10:57,012
Not always against the year.

309
00:10:57,250 --> 00:11:00,360
Real discounts do exist.

310
00:11:00,490 --> 00:11:01,180
Adobe,

311
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,821
which tracks online prices,

312
00:11:02,821 --> 00:11:04,962
measured peak discounts of about

313
00:11:04,962 --> 00:11:07,340
thirty-one percent off listed prices on

314
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:09,219
electronics last season,

315
00:11:09,219 --> 00:11:11,960
and about thirty percent on toys.

316
00:11:12,060 --> 00:11:14,330
The trick is knowing what the listed

317
00:11:14,330 --> 00:11:15,435
price was.

318
00:11:15,683 --> 00:11:18,108
So how does Black Friday actually make

319
00:11:18,108 --> 00:11:19,193
money?

320
00:11:19,283 --> 00:11:20,913
Not on the doorbuster.

321
00:11:20,913 --> 00:11:22,193
On the visit.

322
00:11:22,193 --> 00:11:23,739
The cart around the deal,

323
00:11:23,739 --> 00:11:25,510
the plan at the register,

324
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:27,302
the supplier who chips in for the

325
00:11:27,302 --> 00:11:27,952
markdown,

326
00:11:27,952 --> 00:11:29,969
and the one quarter that carries the

327
00:11:29,969 --> 00:11:30,793
year.

328
00:11:30,933 --> 00:11:33,592
And a whole crowd of card networks,

329
00:11:33,592 --> 00:11:36,278
lenders and ad sellers gets paid whether

330
00:11:36,278 --> 00:11:38,490
your deal was great or not.

331
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:39,369
Next time,

332
00:11:39,369 --> 00:11:42,143
we follow the money behind another hidden

333
00:11:42,143 --> 00:11:44,450
link of the world economy.

334
00:11:44,610 --> 00:11:47,203
This is The Hidden Economics.
